    "message": "Define the exact marked Wang word and prove its periodic plane pullback\n\nUse only Start at zero and actual East/West, South/North matches in the marked-word definition. Pull back along the signed address -x-s*t and prove literal allowed tiles, actual Start, correct matching and independent periods (N,0), (0,N), plus the helical period (-s,1).\n\nPermit every signed shift without a rectangle, unique-Start, divisibility, coprimality or machine-run premise. Record independent full-source review, fresh direct module/check replays and eleven standard-only axiom audits; preserve existence and machine semantics as separate composition obligations.",
